{"id":"6bd4a882e3eaed46","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-badness-number.md","title":"Badness Number","display":"df-badness-number — Badness Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-badness-number","aliases":["58-df-badness-number"],"display":"df-badness-number — Badness Number","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-badness-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-badness-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-badness-number — Badness Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>（基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（集合函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span>（可将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 分割成小纤维所需的最少颜色数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)=\\alpha\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}badness-number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\to\n\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\Bigl\\{\\mu\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;(\\lvert f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]\\rvert&lt;\\kappa)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}badness-number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\to\n\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\Bigl\\{\\mu\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;(\\lvert f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]\\rvert&lt;\\kappa)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个无限正则基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，恒等着色给出上界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，而正则性排除少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 个小纤维覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{bad}_{\\mathrm{col}}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原来的全称着色条件允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=1\">\\(\\mu=1\\)</span>，其最小值恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，不能支持上述结论。</li>\n<li>下标 col 把该一元颜色数同二元平稳坏性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 以及纤维界函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 区分开，避免同名异型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d